<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Costain 1996 full-yr profits up.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Costain 1996 full-yr profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year result for construction firm Costain West Africa to end-September 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover			 1,100    vs  608.5</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	54.5    vs  42.3</p>
<p>Taxation			   9.3    vs  7.1</p>
<p>Profit after payment	  45.2    vs  35.1</p>
<p>Proposed dividend per share 20 kobo vs  25 kobo</p>
<p>($=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
